<HelpTab>
    <HelpSection Title="When you pass">
        <FluentText>
            A "Course completed" message appears and your certificate is emailed to you. You can
            download the certificate straight away, or later from My Training.
        </FluentText>
    </HelpSection>

    <HelpSection Title="Downloading a certificate later">
        <ol>
            <li>Go to <a href="/training">My Training</a>.</li>
            <li>Expand the course's row.</li>
            <li>Select the download button next to the completed assignment. The certificate downloads as a PDF.</li>
        </ol>
    </HelpSection>

    <HelpSection Title="Retakes">
        <FluentText>
            Some courses must be repeated regularly, for example every 12 months. When a retake is
            due, the course is assigned to you again and you get an email reminder. It appears on My
            Training like any other course. Your earlier completions and certificates stay in the
            row's history.
        </FluentText>
    </HelpSection>
</HelpTab>
